      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "an absolute must have. Sometimes I have so much trouble trying to line up properly to go through a portal and it gets super frustrating, going forward and it not working then I gotta back up and align and go forward again, and then it doesn't work, so I gotta back up and align and go forward and then it doesn't work, then I gotta back up and align and go forward. You get the idea, but  a floortal should totally remove that issue, just walk over it and boom teleportation. It would be so nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
